SECTION      | KEY                | VALUE
----------------------------------------
META         | piece_id           | cursword
STATE        | menu_stay_open     | 1
STATE        | grab_pointer       | 1
STATE        | grab_keyboard      | 1
METHOD       | Dir                | sh -c 'mkdir -p "$0/audit"; GDK_BACKEND=x11 xdg-open "$0" >>"$0/audit/dir.log" 2>&1'
METHOD       | Chat               | sh -c 'exec sh "$1/&.widgits/open-hai/chat_button.sh" "$1" "$0/chat" cursword-chat'
METHOD       | Bookmarks          | sh -c 'exec sh "$1/&.widgits/bookmarks/bm_menu.sh" "$1" "$0"'
METHOD       | Play               | sh -c 'exec sh "$1/*.monads/*.muchi-pet/ops/play_event.sh" "$0"'
METHOD       | Close              | CLOSE
METHOD       | Cancel             | void
